# "You may exile a nonland card from it until this creature leaves the battlefield." Bot1 casts the Bat with two Moxen on turn
# 1, looks at Bot2's hand (Island, Lightning Bolt, Counterspell and four more Islands) and exiles the Counterspell; the
# only a nonland card may be chosen. On turn 2 Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Bat and the
# Counterspell returns to Bot2's hand at once (CR 610.3): Exile is empty again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Deep-Cavern Bat
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Mountain
Island x3
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Deep-Cavern Bat.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Counterspell)
? Exile = Counterspell
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Deep-Cavern Bat)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Deep-Cavern Bat
Bot2.Hand = Counterspell; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
